  "prefLabel": "Hedc 502.06 Residency Determination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 502.06 Residency Determination. The following shall be used as proof of the applicant’s status as a New Hampshire resident:\n\n(a) Driver’s license or state-issued identification;\n\n(b) Utility bill;\n\n(c) Lease or rental agreement;\n\n(d) Mortgage or property deed;\n\n(e) Voter registration card;\n\n(f) Vehicle registration;\n\n(g) Bank statements or financial documents;\n\n(h) Employment records; or\n\n(i) Tax documents.\n\nSource. #14213, eff 3-12-25\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATUTE\n\nHedc 501.01-501.02 | RSA 193:19; RSA 193:21; RSA 170-B:2\n\nHedc 502.01 | RSA 193:21\n\nHedc 502.02 | RSA 193:19; RSA 193:21\n\nHedc 502.03-502.05 | RSA 193:21\n\nHedc 502.06 | RSA 193:19; RSA 193:21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hedc500.html"
